      "violations": [
        {
          "id": "COMP-003",
          "count": 1,
          "deduction": -30,
          "detail": "formatarStatus() is a public symbol whose labels the manifest declares a 'contrato de valor' matched by the managerial report and used in the CSV Status column. It now returns 'Desconhecido' for any status other than 1/2/3 (delivered lib.php:77-82), where the legacy code returned 'Resolvido' for the same input (pristine lib.php:32-34). The 1/2/3 labels are preserved, but the same input now gives a different business label, and the function can emit a fourth label outside the contracted set. The model itself admits the schema only defines 1..3 and gave it confidence 60; COMP-003 says the old behavior being ugly is no licence. Attributable to extra finding F14, not to any planted-flaw fix, so no C5/R4 is affected."
        }
      ]
    },
